      "text": "After breakfast, you have the day free in Lima.\n\nYou can book any of the following optional excursions:\n\n**Paracas, the Ballestas Islands and a flight over the Nazca Lines**\n\n- Ballestas Islands and Nazca Lines, full day, $625;\n\n- ancient city of Caral, $275;\n\n**Lima sightseeing tour and the Gold Museum**\n\n- Lima city tour and the Gold Museum, $125;\n\n**Dinner with a folklore show in Lima**\n\n- buffet dinner with Peruvian dishes, a folklore show and transfers, from 19:00 to 22:00.\n\nOvernight at a hotel in Lima. Spend the day at your own pace before your international departure, or add one of the excursions above.",
